WEBVTT

00:00:00.015 --> 00:00:03.630
Easy Folk Tales. Goldilocks and the Three Bears.

00:00:03.630 --> 00:00:07.415
Once there were three bears who lived in a house in the forest.

00:00:07.415 --> 00:00:13.007
There was a great big father bear, a middle-sized mother bear, and a little baby bear.

00:00:13.007 --> 00:00:15.766
One morning their breakfast was too hot to eat.

00:00:15.766 --> 00:00:18.160
So they went for a walk while it cooled.

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:22.675
While they were out, a little girl named Goldilocks came to the house.

00:00:22.675 --> 00:00:24.212
She knocked on the door.

00:00:24.212 --> 00:00:26.704
Nobody answered, so she walked in.

00:00:26.704 --> 00:00:29.085
On the table she saw three bowls.

00:00:29.085 --> 00:00:32.791
She was hungry, so she tried the food in the big bowl.

00:00:32.791 --> 00:00:34.528
"Too hot," she said.

00:00:34.528 --> 00:00:36.197
She tried the middle bowl.

00:00:36.197 --> 00:00:37.170
"Too cold."

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:39.053
Then she tried the little bowl.

00:00:39.053 --> 00:00:42.021
"Just right," she said, and she ate it all.

00:00:42.021 --> 00:00:43.994
Then she saw three chairs.

00:00:43.994 --> 00:00:45.954
The big chair was too hard.

00:00:45.954 --> 00:00:48.078
The middle chair was too soft.

00:00:48.078 --> 00:00:50.115
The little chair was just right.

00:00:50.115 --> 00:00:53.229
But when she sat down, it broke into pieces.

00:00:53.229 --> 00:00:55.171
Goldilocks was tired now.

00:00:55.171 --> 00:00:57.948
She went up the stairs and found three beds.

00:00:57.948 --> 00:00:59.844
The big bed was too hard.

00:00:59.844 --> 00:01:01.913
The middle bed was too soft.

00:01:01.913 --> 00:01:05.701
The little bed was just right, and she fell asleep in it.

00:01:05.701 --> 00:01:07.856
Soon the three bears came home.

00:01:07.856 --> 00:01:13.072
"Somebody has been eating my breakfast," said the father bear in his great big voice.

00:01:13.072 --> 00:01:18.300
"Somebody has been eating my breakfast," said the mother bear in her middle-sized voice.

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:24.331
"Somebody has been eating my breakfast," said the baby bear in his little voice, "and they ate it all!"

00:01:24.331 --> 00:01:28.347
Then they saw the chairs, and the baby bear began to cry.

00:01:28.347 --> 00:01:29.970
They went up the stairs.

00:01:29.970 --> 00:01:35.163
"Somebody has been sleeping in my bed," said the baby bear, "and here she is!"

00:01:35.163 --> 00:01:38.643
Goldilocks woke up and saw the three bears looking at her.

00:01:38.643 --> 00:01:42.657
She jumped out of bed, ran down the stairs and out of the door.

00:01:42.657 --> 00:01:47.094
She ran all the way home, and she never went into that forest again.
